# A1.03/A1_03_numbers_and_personal_info.letz
# Source: Quizlet "A1 Basics Beginner Luxembourgish Lesson 3"

@lesson A1.03 "Numbers & Personal Info"

# --- Numbers 0-10 ---
@word null = zero
@word eent = one
@word zwee = two
@word dräi = three
@word véier = four
@word fënnef = five
@word sechs = six
@word siwen = seven
@word aacht = eight
@word néng = nine
@word zéng = ten

# --- Personal information ---
@word d'Telefonsnummer = the telephone number
@word d'Telefonsnummeren = the telephone numbers
@word de Gebuertsdag = the birthday
@word d'Gebuertsdeeg = the birthdays
@word d'Adress = the address
@word d'Adressen = the addresses
@word de Joer = the year
@word d'Joeren = the years

# --- Family & relationships ---
@word de Brudder = the brother
@word d'Bridder = the brothers
@word d'Schwëster = the sister
@word d'Schwësteren = the sisters
@word d'Kanner = the children
@word de Frënd = the boyfriend
@word d'Frëndin = the girlfriend
@word de Mann = the husband
@word d'Fra = the wife

# --- Marital status ---
@word bestuet = married
@word gescheet = divorced
@word getrennt = separated
@word verloobt = engaged
@word de Jonggesell = the bachelor
@word d'Jonggesellin = the bachelorette
@word de Wittmann = the widower
@word d'Wittfra = the widow

# --- Useful words ---
@word zesummen = together
@word léif = lovely
@word wéini = when
@word gebuer = born
@word um Kierchbierg = in the Kirchberg neighbourhood
@word d'Belsch = Belgium
@word Bréissel = Brussels

# --- Question words ---
@word Wéi vill = How many

# --- Sentences ---

@sentence
@lu Wéi ass deng Telefonsnummer?
@en What is your telephone number?
@distractor-en address
@distractor-en birthday
@distractor-lu Adress
@distractor-lu Gebuertsdag

@sentence
@lu Wéi ass Är Telefonsnummer?
@en What is your telephone number?
@distractor-en my
@distractor-en his
@distractor-lu Meng
@distractor-lu Säin

@sentence
@lu Meng Telefonsnummer ass dräi.
@en My phone number is three.
@distractor-en two
@distractor-en five
@distractor-lu zwee
@distractor-lu fënnef

@sentence
@lu Wou wunnt Dir?
@en Where do you live?
@distractor-en come
@distractor-en how
@distractor-lu kommen
@distractor-lu Wéi

@sentence
@lu Wou wunns du?
@en Where do you live?
@distractor-en work
@distractor-en what
@distractor-lu schaffs
@distractor-lu Wat

@sentence
@lu Ech wunnen an der Belsch, zu Bréissel.
@en I live in Belgium, in Brussels.
@distractor-en France
@distractor-en come
@distractor-lu Frankräich
@distractor-lu kommen

@sentence
@lu Ech wunnen um Kierchbierg.
@en I live in the Kirchberg neighbourhood.
@distractor-en city
@distractor-en country
@distractor-lu Stad
@distractor-lu Land

@sentence
@lu Wéi vill Joer hutt Dir?
@en How old are you?
@distractor-en where
@distractor-en when
@distractor-lu Wou
@distractor-lu Wéini

@sentence
@lu Wéi vill Joer hues du?
@en How old are you?
